  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Iniciativa de Salud Mesoamerica 2015 Costa Rica- Segunda Operacion Individual</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mesoamerican Health Facility 2015 Costa Rica- Second Individual Operation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Contribuir a la reduccin del EA, mediante el desarrollo de un modelo intersectorial para la prevencin y atencin a la maternidad y paternidad precoz, que funcione a travs de redes locales, con modalidades diferenciadas para adolescentes, de acuerdo a sus distintos niveles de exposicin a riesgos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to reducing the EA through the development of an intersectoral model for the prevention and early maternity and paternity, operating through local networks, with different modalities for adolescents, according to different levels of risk exposure .</narrative>
  </description>
